Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5\fscx75\fscy75}Goalkeepers who took their\NGLOVES OFF to save a PENALTY
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.19,0:00:03.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Back in 2004,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.57,0:00:04.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Portugal played
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:04.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}England
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.54,0:00:05.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}in the quarter-final
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.30,0:00:05.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}of the Euros,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.90,0:00:06.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}in Lisbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.51,0:00:07.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}It finished 2-2,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.69,0:00:08.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}so it went
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.06,0:00:08.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}to penalties.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:09.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Beckham missed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.45,0:00:09.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}for England.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.96,0:00:10.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Rui Costa
