Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.41,0:00:12.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}It stayed tight,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.22,0:00:12.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}all the way
